    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grace Park Heights has proved to be a very popular development since it was built in the 70’s due in part to its central location near the city. This cul de sac development is ideal for young families who move in then stay for the convenience. In common with previous sales, number 233 is an executor’s sale of a nice family home in good condition.  It has been upgraded over the years with additional insulation, modern windows and heating so you can comfortably move straight in if you are lucky enough to secure it."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\t\t5.17 m x 2.65m\t\tWith timber flooring and open fire.\r\n\r\nDining Room:\t\t3.35 m x 3.12m\t\tWith timber flooring.\t\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast:\t5.17m x 2.72m\t\tWith wall and floor units and timber flooring. \r\n\r\nGuest bathroom\tWith w.h.b. and w.c.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\nBedroom 1: \t\t4.15m x 2.94m \t   \tWith timber flooring and a built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t\t3.65m x 2.37m \t   \tWith timber flooring and a built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \t\t3.41m x 2.75m \t   \tWith timber flooring and a wardrobe.\t\r\n\r\nBathroom:   \t\t2.72m x 1.90m\t\t\r\nFully tiled, with a shower, w.h.b. & w.c. \t\r\n\t\r\n\r\nFloor area: Circa. 90m sq\r\nSite area  : 190m sq"
